{"product_id":"iqos-iluma-one-kit","title":"IQOS Iluma One Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe IQOS ILUMA ONE takes tobacco heating to the next level. A stylish, compact and portable device using the beloved IQOS technology that has 20 consecutive uses per charge. Its convenient all in one design requires no cleaning and is excellent for everyday usage, no matter where you are.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAll-in-one design, offering up to 20 consecutive uses with a single charge. Next level tobacco experience without blades.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis IQOS device is ONLY compatible with IQOS Terea Sticks\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompact all in one device.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes SMARTCORE INDUCTION SYSTEM™ technology\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUp to 20 consecutive uses with a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy insertion and extraction of the stick\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRapid charging\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo cleaning ever\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustomisation options with accessories\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhy switch to IQOS ILUMA ONE?\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReal Tobacco taste: IQOS ILUMA is specially designed to be used with real tobacco sticks. TEREA sticks provide real tobacco taste \u0026amp; satisfaction.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHarm Reduction: Switching completely to IQOS presents less risk to your health than continuing to smoke. IQOS emits 95% lower levels of harmful chemicals compared to cigarettes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote: Compatible only with Terea Sticks.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41712608018487,"sku":"Iluma One Kit","price":15000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iqos-iluma-one-pebble-beige.jpg?v=1750126480","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-iluma-one-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




